rick block at x~60-80 and a ? at x~95-110. And further right another ? at x~180-195. Mario at x~110-125.\n\nSo a ? block is at screen x~95-110. Mario at screen x~110. Maybe he's slightly right of it; jumping would hit the brick next to it. Let me move left 20 frames then jump.\n\nAlternatively use write 0x0086. Let me read 0x0086 and 0x071C first, and get_tile_at_pixel at (100,150).\n\nLet me do: read_memory 0x0086, read 0x071C, get_tile_at_pixel(100,152).\n\nActually let me just do get_tile_at_pixel for a couple points.\n\nLet me read 0x0086 and 0x071C and get tile at (100,152)."}
